1.(peter son number)


n = int(input("Enter a number: "))
temp = n
s = 0
while temp > 0:
    d = temp % 10
    f = 1
for i in range(1, d + 1):
        f *= i
    s += f
    temp //= 10
if s == n:
    print("Peterson Number")
else:
    print("Not a Peterson Number")
O/p:
Enter a number: 145
Peterson Number


2.(happy number)

n = int(input("Enter a number: "))
temp = n
while temp != 1 and temp != 4:
    s = 0
    while temp > 0:
        d = temp % 10
        s += d * d
        temp //= 10
    temp = s
if temp == 1:
    print("Happy Number")
else:
    print("Not a Happy Number")
O/p:
Enter a number: 19
Happy Number


